Persist, inspect, cancel and execute bounded scan jobs

Usage: aws-inventory job <COMMAND>

Commands:
  submit  Persist a scan specification without loading credentials or making AWS calls
  run     Claim and run up to this many available jobs, then exit; expired leases are recovered
  list    
  show    
  cancel  
  retry   Explicitly requeue a terminal job with a bounded number of additional attempts
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
